SetBonus: {
	VirulentHelm: Stand still to emit a toxic aura!
	AcidMask: Stand still to emit a toxic aura!
	AcidRobe: Stand still to emit a toxic aura!
	AcidVisor: Stand still to emit a toxic aura!
	AlcaliteMask: ""
	AlsisMask:
		'''
		You are a true mage...
		Gain the effects of a mana flower, magic cuffs, and retrieve magic stars from afar
		Mana costs are reduced by 70% and increased magic regeneration
		'''
	ArtisanMask:
		'''
		3, 2, 1 .. Smile! Act like you're on stage will ya :p
		Every little while you'll get a countdown, and when you hear Zero,
		your crit is 100% and damage output is doubled!
		Small bits of paint left in your tracks.
		Crit chance and armor penetration increased by 20!
		'''
	DaedenMask:
		'''
		This armor is really scuffed...
		Gives the ability of a molten quiver!
		-Stuck at 400 max HP, but 20% increased damage for Rangers
		'''
	DaediaMask:
		'''
		Max summons increased by 1
		Summon the stolen souls of the wondrous darkspace in their purest form of moths...
		They will attack enemies for you!
		'''
	DucanblitzCap:
		'''
		Enemies are less likely to target you!
		Blades of Cinder and Rhamenthal will fight alongside you
		Every few seconds you'll gain a major increase to Melee Damage
		An upgraded Govheil set essentially.
		+24% increased Melee damage
		+10% melee crit strike chance
		'''
	ElagentHead:
		'''
		+1 Max Minions
		+45 Max Life
		Hit enemies have a rare chance to be assaulted by angelic power!
		'''
	EldritchianHood:
		'''
		Grants immunity to knockback!
		When you take a hit, gain a temporary attack speed boost based on the amount of damage you took!
		'''
	FlowerHat:
		'''
		Increases life regen by decent amount!
		The armor makes a flowery circle that heals players in it for a large amount!
		Turns all your wooden arrows into flower arrows! Which when hitting a target,
		splits into little golden shots that hit back!
		'''
	GarbageMask:
		'''
		Grants immunity to knockback!
		+2 Summons
		'''
	GovheilHelmet: ""
	GovheilMask:
		'''
		Enemies are less likely to target you!
		Magical Govheil bows will come to your aid!!
		Every few seconds you'll gain a major increase to Magic and Summon damage
		+2 Summons!
		'''
	HuntrianHelmet:
		'''
		Increases life regen by a big amount!
		Reduced Healing Flask cooldown
		DOES NOT STACK with philosophers stone
		'''
	IllurianCrestmask: Enemies are less likely to target you!
	IllurianWarriorHelm: Allows you to walk on water
	JianxinMask:
		'''
		Increases life regen by a great amount!
		Move faster and go along with the watery winds.
		Summons in watery dragons to come and swirl around your character.
		These dragons emit a great becoming amongst the lost dynasty and give 50 Health.
		This aura also lessens enemy damage by 10% and damages enemies.
		Enemies are less likely to target you!
		'''
	MardenthMask:
		'''
		Increases life regen
		Take 10% Less damage
		'''
	MiracleHead:
		'''
		Increases summon damage by 16%
		+2 Max Sentries
		Your attacks have a chance to cleave out a part of the enemy's soul
		Collect these to gain a stacking increase to your whip speed and summon damage!
		Taking damage resets the stack
		'''
	GintzeMask:
		'''
		2 Gintze Guards come to fight for you
		+1 Summons!
		'''
	ScissorianMask:
		'''
		Increases life regen by a great amount!
		Move faster and have less aggro and less enemies spawn around you!
		'''
	ScrappyHead:
		'''
		Summons a turret over your head to shoot a laser at nearby enemies!
		8% increased magic and summon damage
		'''
	ShadeWraithHead:
		'''
		Become greatly empowered for a short time when low on health!
		Just one last breath...
		'''
	TerricHead:
		'''
		You build up magical crit chance over time!
		+20 Max Life
		'''
	AstolfoMask:
		'''
		Increases life regen
		Anyone that touches you gets an ATD (Astolfo Transmitted Disease)
		'''
	VerlHat:
		'''
		Auto gain the abilities of Magic cuffs and Mana Flower!
		Enemies will be attacked by your power of music!
		Every few seconds you'll gain a major increase to Magic and Ranged damage!
		'''
	VerlMask: ""
	VextinMask:
		'''
		Gain the accessory effects of desert boots!
		Automatically run at fast speeds without boots!
		+3 Defense!
		'''
	WindmillionHat:
		'''
		I am wind in a million
		30% Increased throwing attack speed!
		Highly increased throwing weapon knowckback
		'''
	WinterbornHead: Up to three icicles surround you to protect you from attacks!
	WitchenHat:
		'''
		Truly a giver of society! The witches respect you :P
		Gain the effects of a mana flower, magic cuffs
		Extreme mana regeneration
		Mana costs are reduced by 50%
		Flowery Rhythm!
		'''
	XexterianHat:
		'''
		Gain the accessory effects of desert boots!
		Automatically run at fast speeds without boots!
		+5 Defense!
		Gain the effects if Forbidden armor!
		Arrows are heated up with the effects of a molten quiver!
		'''
